WEBVTT

00:12:57.724 --> 00:13:02.610
that makes the body into a city, an aggregation of cells

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:05.022
that are all interconnected

00:13:05.022 --> 00:13:09.854
and that allow certain visual access

00:13:09.854 --> 00:13:12.653
at certain places.

00:13:12.653 --> 00:13:19.356
The last work that I just wanted to share with you

00:13:19.356 --> 00:13:23.158
is "Blind Light," which is perhaps

00:13:23.158 --> 00:13:26.418
the most open work,

00:13:26.418 --> 00:13:28.553
and in a conference of radical openness,

00:13:28.553 --> 00:13:32.561
I think maybe this is as radical as I get,